    ["<Assistant_Title1>【家族-等级规则】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>默契值与等级：</>完成家族每周任务可获取默契值提升家族等级，每周默契值获取上限为<Assistant_Red>2000点</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>每周任务：</>家族成员组队参与对应玩法可获得默契值。\n    <Assistant_Property1>高倍默契值：</>每个任务当周前若干次完成时获得，超出次数后仅获得普通倍率。\n    <Assistant_Property1>刷新时间：</>任务每周刷新。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[家族]|665}，{SendAnswer:[家族-契约方式]|666}，{SendAnswer:[家族-奖励说明]|667}，{SendAnswer:[家族-展台规则]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Правила семейного уровня】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ценность и уровень взаимопонимания: </>Выполняйте еженедельные семейные квесты, чтобы повысить ценность взаимопонимания и повысить уровень семьи. Еженедельный предел значения взаимопонимания составляет <Assistant_Red>2000 очков.</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Еженедельные квесты: </>Члены семьи объединяются для участия в соответствующих мероприятиях, чтобы заработать значение взаимопонимания.\n <Assistant_Property1>Высокая ценность взаимопонимания: </>Зарабатывается при выполнении каждого квеста первые несколько раз в течение недели; после превышения этого предела зарабатывается только обычный множитель.\n <Assistant_Property1>Время обновления: </>Квесты обновляются еженедельно.\n<Assistant_Title3>Рекомендуемый поиск: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Display Stand Rules]|669}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station sequence can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tips: </>When choosing a strategy card, you can deduce the most likely next station type based on your current and remaining stations. Low-difficulty modes provide clearer information about subsequent stations and will not feature consecutive identical stations, which you can use to determine the next station type. In high-difficulty modes, there is no concept of regions, and you can only see the most frequent station types for the next 3 stops. At this point, you may need to combine predictive information from previous stations to make a comprehensive judgment on the station type. \n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize cards that involve guessing stations when you are certain of the next type; consider choosing stable income cards when uncertain. Some cards require combinations to exert greater effects; once you have laid the groundwork for buying and selling cargo, the strength of certain cards will significantly increase."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station Последовательность can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tip